WEBVTT

00:00:00.394 --> 00:00:03.263
Negative
A World of Sorrow

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:06.520
Tonight, all my faith has died

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:10.080
The earth drank it up to the very last drop

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:13.400
Tonight, I was alone in the world

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:16.800
Deep in my heart, the desire was fading

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:20.200
To live alone in a world of sorrow

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:23.720
A cold desert, endless nights

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:26.960
Even when dawn breaks, the days are grey

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:30.480
With a life like this...

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:40.800
Tonight, I turned my eyes toward the sky

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:44.120
Searching for a star
beneath which I could stand

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:47.400
But they had all fallen down to earth

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:50.920
And gave me the strength to admit to myself

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:54.360
That I live alone in a world of sorrow

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:57.760
A cold desert, endless nights

00:00:57.960 --> 00:01:01.240
